[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.02,
    "text": "And now, you have texting."
  },
  {
    "start": 2.36,
    "end": 4.52,
    "text": "Texting has, I think, created"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.54,
    "end": 7.34,
    "text": "passivity within men in pursuit."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.02,
    "end": 10.0,
    "text": "It's given us a way to pursue women"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.02,
    "end": 12.12,
    "text": "without calling, to pursue women"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.14,
    "end": 13.88,
    "text": "without being face-to-face, to"
  },
  {
    "start": 13.9,
    "end": 16.54,
    "text": "pursue women in a way that makes"
  },
  {
