    "text": "us the prize."
  },
  {
    "start": 20.04,
    "end": 22.32,
    "text": "To reiterate, 45% of"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.34,
    "end": 24.5,
    "text": "college-aged men have not asked a"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.52,
