  },
  {
    "start": 25.8,
    "end": 27.64,
    "text": "Correct. Which means they asked her"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.66,
    "end": 28.42,
    "text": "out over text."
  },
  {
    "start": 29.1,
    "end": 30.92,
    "text": "Or, yeah, one way or another."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.94,
    "end": 33.22,
    "text": "And your contention is that"
  },
  {
